{"id": "p1", "kind": "design", "topic_key": "probe.count-redis-batch", "source": "project-a docs/learn/M2.md 面试题 1、2", "text": "点赞数这种高频计数在这个项目里是怎么设计的？为什么写回数据库时写的是绝对值而不是增量？", "key_points": [{"point": "计数先在 Redis 里用 Lua 脚本原子地 HINCRBY，并把文章 ID 记进脏集合（SADD）", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/resources/scripts/count_incr.lua", "start_line": 5, "end_line": 14}], "keywords": ["Lua", "HINCRBY", "SADD", "脏"]}, {"point": "Hash 不存在时脚本返回 -1，Java 先从库里加载初值再重试，避免从 0 开始加覆盖库里的值", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/count/RedisBatchCountService.java", "start_line": 60, "end_line": 67}], "keywords": ["-1", "loadFromDb", "初值"]}, {"point": "定时任务每 10 秒 SPOP 一批脏 ID，读出 Redis 里的绝对值批量 upsert，失败就把 ID 放回脏集合", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/count/RedisBatchCountService.java", "start_line": 110, "end_line": 139}], "keywords": ["flush", "upsertBatch", "SPOP", "绝对值"]}, {"point": "写回绝对值是幂等的：重复执行或失败重试结果都一样；写增量会重复累加", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-web/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/web/job/ScheduledJobs.java", "start_line": 40, "end_line": 45}], "keywords": ["幂等", "重复"]}]}
{"id": "p2", "kind": "risk", "topic_key": "probe.redis-after-commit", "source": "project-a docs/learn/M2.md 面试题 5", "text": "点赞时既要写数据库又要改 Redis 里的计数。在数据库事务里直接操作 Redis 有什么问题？这个项目是怎么处理的？", "key_points": [{"point": "Redis 不受数据库事务控制，事务回滚不会撤销 Redis 的修改，两边会对不上", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/common/AfterCommit.java", "start_line": 6, "end_line": 10}], "keywords": ["回滚", "不受", "事务"]}, {"point": "用 TransactionSynchronization 的 afterCommit 把改 Redis 的操作推迟到事务提交之后", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/common/AfterCommit.java", "start_line": 15, "end_line": 26}], "keywords": ["afterCommit", "AfterCommit", "TransactionSynchronization"]}, {"point": "likeArticle 在事务里只写点赞记录和 outbox，计数和点赞者列表放进 AfterCommit.run", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/interaction/LikeService.java", "start_line": 56, "end_line": 73}], "keywords": ["likeArticle", "AfterCommit.run"]}]}
{"id": "p3", "kind": "design", "topic_key": "probe.outbox", "source": "project-a docs/learn/M3.md 面试题 1", "text": "写数据库和发消息怎么保证一致？这个项目用的是什么方案？", "key_points": [{"point": "本地消息表：业务事务里把消息写进 outbox 表，用 Propagation.MANDATORY 保证必须在外层事务里", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/outbox/OutboxService.java", "start_line": 36, "end_line": 49}], "keywords": ["outbox", "MANDATORY", "本地消息表"]}, {"point": "事务提交后立即异步发送（afterCommit → publishAsync）", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/outbox/OutboxService.java", "start_line": 51, "end_line": 57}], "keywords": ["afterCommit", "publishAsync"]}, {"point": "中继任务定时捞出到期未确认的消息补发，按指数退避，超过最大次数标记失败", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/outbox/OutboxPublisher.java", "start_line": 49, "end_line": 74}], "keywords": ["relayDue", "backoff", "重试"]}, {"point": "发布确认（confirm）收到 ack 才标记已发送，消息设为持久化", "evidence": [{"path": "backend/code-nest-service/src/main/java/io/github/qq3939/codenest/service/outbox/OutboxPublisher.java", "start_line": 76, "end_line": 98}], "keywords": ["confirm", "ack", "PERSISTENT"]}]}
